# Private key material must never be committed (QA-002). Keys live
# outside the repo (see docs/agents/agent-13/OWNER-RUNBOOK.md); public
# keys (*.pub, e.g. publisher-ed25519.pub) are NOT matched on purpose.
# Broad name patterns like *secret* / *credential* are deliberately
# NOT used: src/security/proxyCredentialVault.js is legitimate source.
